                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n%%======================\n%% User Layer\n%%======================\nsubgraph L1[\&quot;User Layer\&quot;]\n    USER[User]\nend\n\n%%======================\n%% Application Layer\n%%======================\nsubgraph L2[\&quot;Application Layer\&quot;]\n    FE[Frontend Dashboard]\n    BE[Backend Server]\n    DB[(MySQL Database)]\nend\n\n%%======================\n%% Communication Layer\n%%======================\nsubgraph L3[\&quot;Communication Layer\&quot;]\n    ESP[ESP8266 Monitoring Node]\nend\n\n%%======================\n%% Embedded Layer\n%%======================\nsubgraph L4[\&quot;Embedded Layer\&quot;]\n\n    subgraph SENSORS[\&quot;Environmental Sensors\&quot;]\n        TEMP[Temperature Sensor]\n        HUM[Humidity Sensor]\n        LIGHT[Light Sensor]\n    end\n\n    STM[STM32 Control Node]\n\n    RELAY[Relay Module]\n\n    FAN[Fan]\n    LAMP[Light]\n    BUZZER[Buzzer]\n\nend\n\n%%======================\n%% User\n%%======================\nUSER -- HTTPS --&gt; FE\n\n%%======================\n%% Application\n%%======================\nFE -- REST API --&gt; BE\nBE -- SQL --&gt; DB\n\n%%======================\n%% Monitoring\n%%======================\nTEMP -- I2C/GPIO --&gt; ESP\nHUM -- I2C/GPIO --&gt; ESP\nLIGHT -- I2C/GPIO --&gt; ESP\n\nESP -- MQTT / HTTP --&gt; BE\n\n%%======================\n%% Control\n%%======================\nBE -- Control Command --&gt; STM\n\nSTM -- GPIO --&gt; RELAY\n\nRELAY --&gt; FAN\nRELAY --&gt; LAMP\nRELAY --&gt; BUZZER&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="gXgzNO56V3myk6shRmft-1">
